# iBoot Droid fstab for j171/j172 (iPad 7, T8010)
# Layout: no super/dynamic partitions; system-as-root GSI unpacked into the
# root partition; separate vendor, metadata and data partitions.
#
# @SYSTEMPARTUUID, @VENDORPARTUUID, @BOOTPARTUUID and @DATAPARTUUID are
# substituted by the installer at install time, like the BLS entry's
# root= line: identity by PARTUUID only, never by partition number.
#
# fsmgr_flags: no verity and no avb (tethered boot, no verified boot chain
# on this port). Filesystem for /data starts as ext4; f2fs arrives as its
# own tuning delta in M2.

@SYSTEMPARTUUID / ext4 rw,barrier=1 wait,first_stage_mount
@VENDORPARTUUID /vendor ext4 ro,barrier=1 wait,first_stage_mount
@BOOTPARTUUID /metadata ext4 rw,barrier=1 wait,first_stage_mount
@DATAPARTUUID /data ext4 rw,barrier=1 wait,first_stage_mount,check
